{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DLLL6eGT0F1793267232.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>近日網上流傳一段影片，有網民直擊一名單車客在公路左側車道騎行。片中該名單車客戴上頭盔，車身上掛著多個袋子；當時後方有一輛九巴在同車道行駛，司機見狀隨即切線避讓，過程引起關注。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-29-17h37m57s115.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RVvX66vdiE1793267215.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相關畫面隨即掀起網民熱烈討論，有網民好奇其行程及原因，留言笑問：「踩單車返屯門？」、「咩玩法呢？」。不過，多數網民則對單車客的安全表示擔憂，直言公路大車多，留言提醒：「好多大車經過」、「一唔小心就大件事。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.435944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.398194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:26.559282+00:00","content_hash":"3603986f9db862d1d0cb241ee44ff6c6c9b4d9b1ba9ec3fa0c9e4dee470339a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.435944+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}